          "cost": {
            "gems": 2,
            "gold": 3000,
            "ore": 5,
            "wood": 5
          },
          "description": "Recruits Dragonguard. Base weekly growth: 3. Grounded polearm infantry with charge immunity; no generic dragon-slaying or breath immunity is implied.",
