            "gems": 2,
            "gold": 5000,
            "ore": 10,
            "wood": 5
          },
          "description": "Recruits melee Mageseekers. Base weekly growth: 2. Enemy hero spells cost +1 mana while an eligible stack is alive; splitting stacks does not multiply the surcharge.",
