          "cost": {
            "gems": 3,
            "gold": 3500,
            "ore": 5
          },
          "description": "Recruits Veteran Dragonguard and upgrades Dragonguard for the difference in full recruitment costs. Fire-school spell protection does not reduce ordinary physical dragon breath.",
