          "cost": {
            "gems": 3,
            "gold": 5000,
            "wood": 10
          },
          "description": "Grants defending living troops one additional morale under native caps. The first eligible visiting hero receives one local Demacian Ranger escort automatically, once per town each week shared across visitors. A full army without room for Rangers leaves the claim available. Capture does not reset the weekly claim. This is reinforcement, not resurrection.",
